description "Jedi Youngling 

Tiny Jedi-in-training. They don't know what they're going to do.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 20% faster RoF
- Training Lightsaber (Yellow/Blue)
-- Saber/Blaster Defense (1)
-- Blaster Deflect (1)
-- 20% more special damage
-- 25% shorter
-- Saber Throw ^3[CS1]
--- 16% more damage

^5Force Powers:
- Jump (2) 
- Push (1)
- Pull (1)
- Sense (1)

^6Inventory:
- Defense Seeker ^3[CS2]

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcements (2)
- Force Block (2)
- Assemble (2)
- 10% more knockback taken"